{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38292","headline":"拥鼻 · 韩偓","name":"拥鼻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拥鼻悲吟一向愁，寒更转尽未回头。\n绿屏无睡秋分簟，红叶伤心月午楼。\n却要因循添逸兴，若爲趋竞怆离忧。\n殷勤凭仗官渠水，爲到西溪动钓舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}